    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "4e5332d30db08422e0272b8a3e2f1fd0a2d980524710e1c6dcbcd27a01247796",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "エンプーサ娘のパナティスさんは、\n言葉遣いがとっても悪いんです。\nでも口撃されてしまうと、なんだかクセになってしまって――。",
      "jp_sha256": "20a2915adec52720a786253020101db606a4ad4b7904c1b2277fd304f91e11ec",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "엠푸사 소녀 파나티스 씨는,\n말버릇이 아주 나쁘거든요.\n하지만 말로 공격당하면 왠지 버릇이 돼 버려서――.",
      "message_index_0based": 9,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 41,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "e0babf8a95456107fdbf14002fa4ee68255a6d3d0c5f85589f4d29c1b58190e5:000000_-4194773648361202595:g0:r40",
      "row_index_0based": 40,
      "serialized_row_index": 40,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "チュニーラ",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "エンプーサ娘のパナティスさんは、\n言葉遣いがとっても悪いんです。\nでも口撃されてしまうと、なんだかクセになってしまって――。",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "チュニーラ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "da04330b30cb6505d3db57bb59f4b6e96f94821ee51b5e89351cc833cf9ddb80",
